WEBVTT

00:20:28.513 --> 00:20:30.393
So my advice to you is:

00:20:30.417 --> 00:20:32.147
look at what's in your hand --

00:20:32.171 --> 00:20:35.710
your identity, your influence,
your income --

00:20:36.861 --> 00:20:39.364
and say, "It's not about me.

00:20:39.388 --> 00:20:42.428
It's about making the world
a better place."

00:20:43.434 --> 00:20:44.584
Thank you.